ate social card platform to play Texas Hold\u2019em in VR. Compete against your friends and other Gear, Go and Oculus players in 4 unique environments.\n\nAs the first platform to offer private tables for rent by the hour, MetaTable Poker allows you create a game and invite your friends to play by providing them with a unique PIN number. You can use private tables to test your friends\u2019 poker skills or just hang out and chat in VR.\n\nAnd what\u2019s a poker game without food, drink, funny hats and other objects to play with? MetaTable Poker allows you to spend your hard-earned chips on 32 unique objects. You can share these objects with your friends at the table.\n\nSome of MetaTable Poker\u2019s features:\n\n- Realistic Texas Hold\u2019em gameplay\n- Oculus Avatar support\n- Voice chat\n- Private table rental\n- Objects to purchase with your chips\n- 4 unique environments", "short_description": "MetaTable Poker is the ultimate social card platform to play Texas Hold\u2019em in VR."}]}, "developer_name": "Tiny Content", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.metatable.co/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.metatable.co/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Tiny Content", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://metatable.co/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SOCIAL", "CASUAL", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2845095985788652"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offe